---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Documentation — Fathom" activePage="docs">
  <div class="docs-hero">
    <span class="docs-badge" data-i18n="docsIndex.badge">Documentation</span>
    <h1 class="docs-hero-title">Fathom</h1>
    <p class="docs-hero-subtitle" data-i18n="docsIndex.heroSub">
      Universal autonomous AI workers for research, coding, computer use, scheduled operations, and governed automation.
      Written in Rust for maximum performance and reliability.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="quick-start" id="quick-start">
    <h2 data-i18n="docsIndex.qsTitle">Quick Start</h2>
    <p data-i18n="docsIndex.qsSub">Get up and running in three steps.</p>

    <div class="step-grid">
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="docsIndex.step1Title">Request Access</h3>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.step1Desc">Email us to request a server with full access to the runtime, API, and dashboard.</p>
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-header">
            <span class="code-lang">email</span>
          </div>
          <pre><code>hello@fathom.uz</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="docsIndex.step2Title">Configure</h3>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.step2Desc">Configure your LLM provider credentials and choose a search backend.</p>
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-header">
            <span class="code-lang">~/.fathom/config.toml</span>
          </div>
          <pre><code><span class="code-section">[llm]</span>
provider = <span class="code-string">"deepseek"</span>
api_key  = <span class="code-string">"sk-your-key"</span>
model    = <span class="code-string">"deepseek-chat"</span>

<span class="code-section">[search]</span>
backend  = <span class="code-string">"hybrid"</span></code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="docsIndex.step3Title">Run</h3>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.step3Desc">Launch an autonomous task with a natural language instruction.</p>
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-header">
            <span class="code-lang">bash</span>
          </div>
          <pre><code>fathom run <span class="code-string">"Find B2B SaaS startups in Berlin with 10-50 employees"</span></code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="docs-section">
    <h2 data-i18n="docsIndex.keyTitle">Key Sections</h2>
    <p data-i18n="docsIndex.keySub">Explore the documentation to get the most out of Fathom.</p>

    <div class="link-grid">
      <a href="/docs/quickstart" class="link-card">
        <div class="link-card-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="docsIndex.card1Title">Quickstart</h3>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.card1Desc">Install, configure, and run your first autonomous task in minutes.</p>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/docs/configuration" class="link-card">
        <div class="link-card-icon">⚙️</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="docsIndex.card2Title">Configuration</h3>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.card2Desc">Full reference for config.toml: LLM, search, agents, notifications, and more.</p>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/docs/tools" class="link-card">
        <div class="link-card-icon">🔧</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="docsIndex.card3Title">Tools</h3>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.card3Desc">51 always-registered tools plus up to 5 CDP browser tools and up to 6 computer tools, plus MCP/plugins: web, coding, browser CDP, security, memory, and file operations.</p>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/docs/api" class="link-card">
        <div class="link-card-icon">📡</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="docsIndex.card4Title">API Reference</h3>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.card4Desc">HTTP API, SSE event stream, and CLI commands for programmatic access.</p>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/security" class="link-card">
        <div class="link-card-icon">🛡</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="docsIndex.card5Title">Security</h3>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.card5Desc">SSRF guards, secret detection, sandboxed execution, prompt injection defense, and verification receipts.</p>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/integrations" class="link-card">
        <div class="link-card-icon">🔌</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="docsIndex.card6Title">Integrations</h3>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.card6Desc">CRM sync (amoCRM, Bitrix24, HubSpot), MCP client/server, browser automation, notifications, and export formats.</p>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="docs-section">
    <h2 data-i18n="docsIndex.whatTitle">What is Fathom?</h2>
    <p data-i18n="docsIndex.what1">
      Fathom is a universal autonomous AI worker platform for research, coding, computer use,
      scheduled operations, memory, governance, and reviewable automation — all from one command-line interface.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n="docsIndex.what2">
      Built in Rust for speed and reliability, it orchestrates multiple sub-agents that work in parallel,
      using 51 always-registered tools plus up to 5 CDP browser tools and up to 6 computer tools, with MCP/plugin extensions for web search, browser automation, OSINT pipelines, coding, and file operations.
    </p>

    <div class="feature-pills">
      <span class="pill" data-i18n="docsIndex.pill1">🦀 Rust Core</span>
      <span class="pill" data-i18n="docsIndex.pill2">51 Always + Up to 5 CDP + Up to 6 Computer</span>
      <span class="pill" data-i18n="docsIndex.pill3">Multi-Agent</span>
      <span class="pill" data-i18n="docsIndex.pill4">OSINT Pipeline</span>
      <span class="pill" data-i18n="docsIndex.pill5">TUI Interface</span>
      <span class="pill" data-i18n="docsIndex.pill6">HTTP API</span>
      <span class="pill" data-i18n="docsIndex.pill7">MCP Support</span>
      <span class="pill" data-i18n="docsIndex.pill8">7 Search Backends</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="docs-section">
    <h2 data-i18n="docsIndex.modesTitle">Running Modes</h2>
    <div class="modes-grid">
      <div class="mode-card">
        <h4>CLI</h4>
        <div class="code-block compact">
          <pre><code>fathom run <span class="code-string">"your query"</span></code></pre>
        </div>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.modeCliDesc">Headless, one-shot tasks from the terminal.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card">
        <h4>TUI</h4>
        <div class="code-block compact">
          <pre><code>fathom tui</code></pre>
        </div>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.modeTuiDesc">Interactive terminal UI with real-time progress.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card">
        <h4 data-i18n="docsIndex.modeHttpTitle">HTTP Server</h4>
        <div class="code-block compact">
          <pre><code>fathom serve</code></pre>
        </div>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.modeHttpDesc">REST API + SSE + dashboard at /dashboard.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card">
        <h4 data-i18n="docsIndex.modeMcpTitle">MCP Server</h4>
        <div class="code-block compact">
          <pre><code>fathom mcp-serve</code></pre>
        </div>
        <p data-i18n="docsIndex.modeMcpDesc">Expose all tools to MCP clients (Claude, ZCode, etc.).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

<style>
  .docs-hero {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .docs-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 5px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--accent-light);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .docs-hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .docs-hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .quick-start {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .quick-start > p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .step-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .step-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 28px;
    min-width: 0;
    transition: all var(--duration) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .step-card:hover {
    background: var(--bg-card-hover);
    border-color: var(--text-tertiary);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .step-number {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--text-inverse);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .step-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .step-card > p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .code-block {
    background: var(--bg-dark);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .code-block.compact pre {
    padding: 12px 16px;
  }

  .code-header {
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .code-lang {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .code-block pre {
    padding: 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .code-block code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }

  :global(.code-string) {
    color: #A8D8A8;
  }

  :global(.code-section) {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .docs-section {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .docs-section > p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .link-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .link-card {
    display: block;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 28px;
    position: relative;
    transition: all var(--duration) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .link-card:hover {
    background: var(--bg-card-hover);
    border-color: var(--text-tertiary);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .link-card-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .link-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .link-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .link-card-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 28px;
    right: 28px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    transition: all var(--duration) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .link-card:hover .link-card-arrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .feature-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    transition: all var(--duration) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .pill:hover {
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .modes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .mode-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .mode-card h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .mode-card .code-block {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .mode-card p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .step-grid,
    .link-grid,
    .modes-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .docs-hero-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
</DocsLayout>
